(3781390, 535387, 67258, '<td valign="top">Stunning model, stunning photography.  Love the composition, with just the right amount of negative space to make for really comfortable viewing. You must have a real rapport with your model - the way you have photographed her, you make the viewer feel as though she is looking directly at them; a very intense, intimate look.<br/> <br/>-----------<br/> <br/>This comment courtesy the Viral Comment Experiment (VCE). The VCE is an experiment to see if a large number of quality comments can be generated in a fashion similar to chain letters. The first time you receive a VCE comment, randomly choose five (5) images from this challenge (or another challenge) and leave quality, useful comments/critiques like this one. Make sure to mention good things as well as bad things. Then, see how many you receive in return over the next few weeks. Make sure you copy this VCE notice at the end of each comment. [Obligatory chain letter threat] If you do not make five quality comments within 24 hours, your hard drive will crash and your camera''s shutter will fail at an inopportune moment.</td>', 'Stunning model, stunning photography.  Love the composition, with just the right amount of negative space to make for really comfortable viewing. You must have a real rapport with your model - the way you have photographed her, you make the viewer feel as though she is looking directly at them; a very intense, intimate look. ----------- This comment courtesy the Viral Comment Experiment (VCE). The VCE is an experiment to see if a large number of quality comments can be generated in a fashion similar to chain letters. The first time you receive a VCE comment, randomly choose five (5) images from this challenge (or another challenge) and leave quality, useful comments/critiques like this one. Make sure to mention good things as well as bad things. Then, see how many you receive in return over the next few weeks. Make sure you copy this VCE notice at the end of each comment. [Obligatory chain letter threat] If you do not make five quality comments within 24 hours, your hard drive will crash and your camera''s shutter will fail at an inopportune moment.', '2007-06-14 02:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
