(3781609, 533291, 24073, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t scream pure, but I''m sure you will hear that -my comment.  So my compliments on the photo itself.  The colors are great, and your timing was pretty awesome.  There are two quite noticable imperfections though, One tires in the background really scream green, and line to the front is off balance.  I still think its a great photo.  GL.</td>', 'It doesn''t scream pure, but I''m sure you will hear that -my comment.  So my compliments on the photo itself.  The colors are great, and your timing was pretty awesome.  There are two quite noticable imperfections though, One tires in the background really scream green, and line to the front is off balance.  I still think its a great photo.  GL.', '2007-06-14 02:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
