(3782715, 534284, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s a great detail shot, and I''m speaking as a former Porsche owner and a lover of the marque. But of the many ways you might have used the car to illustrate "performance", this surely is one of the least apt? And in the matter of "purity", this is a complex image and I don''t take a sense of "pure" from it at all...</td>', 'It''s a great detail shot, and I''m speaking as a former Porsche owner and a lover of the marque. But of the many ways you might have used the car to illustrate "performance", this surely is one of the least apt? And in the matter of "purity", this is a complex image and I don''t take a sense of "pure" from it at all...', '2007-06-14 10:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
