(3782728, 534746, 30861, '<td valign="top">We must have a different idea of what "elegance" is, LOL; dead trees don''t look very elegant to me. Still, it''s just a title. The sky is lovely. The dark areas are blocking up a little, so the tree trunk''s not separating from the hedgerow/treeline behind, and that hurts the shot. I''m seeing sharpening artefacts where the branches are against the sky also.</td>', 'We must have a different idea of what "elegance" is, LOL; dead trees don''t look very elegant to me. Still, it''s just a title. The sky is lovely. The dark areas are blocking up a little, so the tree trunk''s not separating from the hedgerow/treeline behind, and that hurts the shot. I''m seeing sharpening artefacts where the branches are against the sky also.', '2007-06-14 10:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
