(3782748, 534126, 30861, '<td valign="top">I wish I wasn''t losing the arch of this wonderful bridge against all the dark and clutter, and I wish the top wasn''t precisely tangent to the hills behind; the end result is that the thing you are photographing is not popping out of the picture as "subject"; the roadway itself, and even the boat/wake lower right, are much stronger visually than the arch of the bridge.</td>', 'I wish I wasn''t losing the arch of this wonderful bridge against all the dark and clutter, and I wish the top wasn''t precisely tangent to the hills behind; the end result is that the thing you are photographing is not popping out of the picture as "subject"; the roadway itself, and even the boat/wake lower right, are much stronger visually than the arch of the bridge.', '2007-06-14 10:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782754, 533937, 30861, '<td valign="top">wowsers :-) Please feel free to PM me and tell me what the heck that is  I''m done voting on this lovely shot.</td>', 'wowsers :-) Please feel free to PM me and tell me what the heck that is  I''m done voting on this lovely shot.', '2007-06-14 10:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782766, 534682, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nicely presented, if a bit lifeless for my sensibilities; the water is completely frozen, the fish is slumping, there''s no sense of stop-ACTION at all. This isn''t a flaw, exactly, but the whole image seems technically excellent and emotionally void to me, it''s not really grabbing em at all. The fish looks distinctly bummed out, which kind of undercuts the idea of purity in a strange way; were he being more active, the image would work better for me.</td>', 'Nicely presented, if a bit lifeless for my sensibilities; the water is completely frozen, the fish is slumping, there''s no sense of stop-ACTION at all. This isn''t a flaw, exactly, but the whole image seems technically excellent and emotionally void to me, it''s not really grabbing em at all. The fish looks distinctly bummed out, which kind of undercuts the idea of purity in a strange way; were he being more active, the image would work better for me.', '2007-06-14 10:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782773, 535540, 30861, '<td valign="top">Really nice tonalities, really nice bordering. To my eyes, however, you''ve given too much picture area tot he BG; I want the flower to be more prominent, so I can glory in every detail of it. When I expand this to 600 horizontal (which would mean a squarish crop) it works MUCH better for me.</td>', 'Really nice tonalities, really nice bordering. To my eyes, however, you''ve given too much picture area tot he BG; I want the flower to be more prominent, so I can glory in every detail of it. When I expand this to 600 horizontal (which would mean a squarish crop) it works MUCH better for me.', '2007-06-14 10:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782779, 534617, 30861, '<td valign="top">way, way, WAY dark; what happened? Color that dark is anything but pure...</td>', 'way, way, WAY dark; what happened? Color that dark is anything but pure...', '2007-06-14 10:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782781, 534365, 30861, '<td valign="top">too cute :-)</td>', 'too cute :-)', '2007-06-14 10:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782788, 533435, 30861, '<td valign="top">A little work with shadow/highlight, or its equivalent, would do wonders to bring out the faces here and greatly improve what''s a very nice shot of mother and daughter</td>', 'A little work with shadow/highlight, or its equivalent, would do wonders to bring out the faces here and greatly improve what''s a very nice shot of mother and daughter', '2007-06-14 10:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782794, 534518, 30861, '<td valign="top">Theatre or ballet? I''d have thought the latter... Not affecting my vote though...</td>', 'Theatre or ballet? I''d have thought the latter... Not affecting my vote though...', '2007-06-14 10:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782807, 534728, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nice shot in many ways, but the ashtray is hideous, at least IMO. I''d love it with a white ashtray, or a simple design anyway; what you actually used is competing with the key elements. Be nice if you''d squared the ashtray up with the image edge also...</td>', 'Nice shot in many ways, but the ashtray is hideous, at least IMO. I''d love it with a white ashtray, or a simple design anyway; what you actually used is competing with the key elements. Be nice if you''d squared the ashtray up with the image edge also...', '2007-06-14 10:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3782818, 534558, 30861, '<td valign="top">really nice image, metaphorically. One of the few "innocent child" shots that raises above the obvious and engages me intellectually. Of course,t hat''s probably the kiss of death. Good luck!</td>', 'really nice image, metaphorically. One of the few "innocent child" shots that raises above the obvious and engages me intellectually. Of course,t hat''s probably the kiss of death. Good luck!', '2007-06-14 10:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
