(3789640, 534269, 64670, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this photo is very flattering.  The half light half shade is a distraction. I''m sure the child is beautiful, this shot doesn''t do them justice I''m afraid.</td>', 'I don''t think this photo is very flattering.  The half light half shade is a distraction. I''m sure the child is beautiful, this shot doesn''t do them justice I''m afraid.', '2007-06-15 20:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
