(3793048, 534768, 79021, '<td valign="top">I figured that this challenge would be filled with pictures of babies and little kids, but I think this image separates itself from the rest.  The lighting on the face makes it a very peaceful image while the car on the right keeps it from looking like the kid is sad.  I''d say top 10, probably top 3</td>', 'I figured that this challenge would be filled with pictures of babies and little kids, but I think this image separates itself from the rest.  The lighting on the face makes it a very peaceful image while the car on the right keeps it from looking like the kid is sad.  I''d say top 10, probably top 3', '2007-06-17 04:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
