(3794171, 534993, 18197, '<td valign="top">Too soft and too highly post processed for my taste.</td>', 'Too soft and too highly post processed for my taste.', '2007-06-17 17:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3794173, 529644, 18197, '<td valign="top">Too small an image. Not getting the connection with the challenge theme.</td>', 'Too small an image. Not getting the connection with the challenge theme.', '2007-06-17 17:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3794196, 533397, 18197, '<td valign="top">I get the political statement (even though whales is misspelled. How embarrassing! Or are you worried about Wales, part of the UK? Sorry, I digress.) Your choice of colors is certainly jarring and would capture my attention if I saw it in a magazine ad, for example. It is itchy, and it makes me uncomfortable with the notion of whaling. Retro border works. So you have succeeded well at conveying an emotional payload with your photo. Good! But I can''t honestly say I like the photo.</td>', 'I get the political statement (even though whales is misspelled. How embarrassing! Or are you worried about Wales, part of the UK? Sorry, I digress.) Your choice of colors is certainly jarring and would capture my attention if I saw it in a magazine ad, for example. It is itchy, and it makes me uncomfortable with the notion of whaling. Retro border works. So you have succeeded well at conveying an emotional payload with your photo. Good! But I can''t honestly say I like the photo.', '2007-06-17 17:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3794197, 534935, 18197, '<td valign="top">You''ve kind of lost me with the post processing. Not sure I get the connection with the challenge theme.</td>', 'You''ve kind of lost me with the post processing. Not sure I get the connection with the challenge theme.', '2007-06-17 17:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3794204, 534206, 18197, '<td valign="top">Other than the title, I don''t get the connection with the challenge theme. I suppose you were there and were partaking of the titled adult beverage, so maybe you are emotionally connected with the people or the situation.  I do like your processing in as much as it reinforces the title. The subjects and their expressions fit into that context. But without that personal connection, the photo isn''t very interesting to me.</td>', 'Other than the title, I don''t get the connection with the challenge theme. I suppose you were there and were partaking of the titled adult beverage, so maybe you are emotionally connected with the people or the situation.  I do like your processing in as much as it reinforces the title. The subjects and their expressions fit into that context. But without that personal connection, the photo isn''t very interesting to me.', '2007-06-17 17:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3794208, 533399, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Wonderful textures. Nice leading line formed by the mist. It''s a little dark on my calibrated monitor ... you may lose points for that, or fail to attract voters who just vote the thumbs. But top marks from me! Best in show.</td>', 'Lovely. Wonderful textures. Nice leading line formed by the mist. It''s a little dark on my calibrated monitor ... you may lose points for that, or fail to attract voters who just vote the thumbs. But top marks from me! Best in show.', '2007-06-17 17:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3794211, 534445, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully executed interpretation of the challenge theme. Among my favorites this challenge.</td>', 'Wonderfully executed interpretation of the challenge theme. Among my favorites this challenge.', '2007-06-17 17:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3794212, 534518, 18197, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully executed interpretation of the challenge theme. Among my favorites this challenge. I especially like the high contrast. Composition of the hands and arms is perfect. Beautifully focused and presented.</td>', 'Wonderfully executed interpretation of the challenge theme. Among my favorites this challenge. I especially like the high contrast. Composition of the hands and arms is perfect. Beautifully focused and presented.', '2007-06-17 17:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3794217, 535397, 18197, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Very zen. Great interpretation of the theme. I''d hang it on my wall ... among my favorites this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful! Very zen. Great interpretation of the theme. I''d hang it on my wall ... among my favorites this challenge.', '2007-06-17 17:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3794219, 533883, 18197, '<td valign="top">I love these Herens. I''ll never tire of seeing them in nature and in photos here. Great photo and choice for the theme. Among my favorites. There are some processing artifacts that bother me some: The farther wing looks like a bit too much noise reduction was applied; There are some sharpening artifacts on the bird''s neck; and it looks like there are some jpg jaggies. These diminish the photo slightly from my perspective ... but it''s still a great capture. High degree of difficulty. Well executed, considering.</td>', 'I love these Herens. I''ll never tire of seeing them in nature and in photos here. Great photo and choice for the theme. Among my favorites. There are some processing artifacts that bother me some: The farther wing looks like a bit too much noise reduction was applied; There are some sharpening artifacts on the bird''s neck; and it looks like there are some jpg jaggies. These diminish the photo slightly from my perspective ... but it''s still a great capture. High degree of difficulty. Well executed, considering.', '2007-06-17 17:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3794221, 533983, 18197, '<td valign="top">That''s REALLY red! I love the details you''ve captured and the composition. Fits the theme well. Among my favorites.</td>', 'That''s REALLY red! I love the details you''ve captured and the composition. Fits the theme well. Among my favorites.', '2007-06-17 17:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3794227, 532313, 18197, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition with the smoke leading my eye around the image and the wingwalker completing the circle. Good colors. Some sharpening artifacts along the leading edges of the wings. Good saturation. Focus could stand to be a bit more precise ... but very hard in practice. Among my favorites.</td>', 'Very strong composition with the smoke leading my eye around the image and the wingwalker completing the circle. Good colors. Some sharpening artifacts along the leading edges of the wings. Good saturation. Focus could stand to be a bit more precise ... but very hard in practice. Among my favorites.', '2007-06-17 17:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3794432, 530678, 76089, '<td valign="top">Nutty and cute...I especially like her hair.  I think the picture would benefit from a low angle of capture to make the figures appear larger and more human.</td>', 'Nutty and cute...I especially like her hair.  I think the picture would benefit from a low angle of capture to make the figures appear larger and more human.', '2007-06-17 18:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
