(3801733, 534751, 8522, '<td valign="top">Would be a lovely photo if the baby''s expression was more co-operative. Here, it really makes me want to laugh at how much he/she didn''t want the photo to work. I don''t think the square crop works here. Conversion to b&amp;w hasn''t gone well... did you use the channel mixer in PS? Shame the clothes are overexposed, this takes attention away from the faces. Baby''s face is also slightly overexposed. Looks like onboard flash was used, which is not good. Buy an external flash!</td>', 'Would be a lovely photo if the baby''s expression was more co-operative. Here, it really makes me want to laugh at how much he/she didn''t want the photo to work. I don''t think the square crop works here. Conversion to b&w hasn''t gone well... did you use the channel mixer in PS? Shame the clothes are overexposed, this takes attention away from the faces. Baby''s face is also slightly overexposed. Looks like onboard flash was used, which is not good. Buy an external flash!', '2007-06-19 14:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801736, 534524, 53243, '<td valign="top">I think the white it too blown out.</td>', 'I think the white it too blown out.', '2007-06-19 14:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801742, 533183, 8522, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the strange crop works, what was wrong with 2/3 or 3/4? The man is too close to the edge of the frame... what''s wrong with rule of thirds here? The red/orange doesn''t work too well for me, I''d be tempted to colour balance it. The silhouette isn''t really strong, was it possible to move around to get a better angle? The object on the upper right edge of the frame really kills the composition. The change in consistency in the water at the top of the frame is also not good for the composition, I wonder why you left it in?</td>', 'I don''t think the strange crop works, what was wrong with 2/3 or 3/4? The man is too close to the edge of the frame... what''s wrong with rule of thirds here? The red/orange doesn''t work too well for me, I''d be tempted to colour balance it. The silhouette isn''t really strong, was it possible to move around to get a better angle? The object on the upper right edge of the frame really kills the composition. The change in consistency in the water at the top of the frame is also not good for the composition, I wonder why you left it in?', '2007-06-19 14:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801744, 532234, 8522, '<td valign="top">An unusual composition, no rule of thirds for you! Somehow this seems to work. I really like the bokeh and splashes of blue. I do think you could perhaps take off a little off the right hand side.</td>', 'An unusual composition, no rule of thirds for you! Somehow this seems to work. I really like the bokeh and splashes of blue. I do think you could perhaps take off a little off the right hand side.', '2007-06-19 14:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801752, 535243, 53243, '<td valign="top">beautiful, close up</td>', 'beautiful, close up', '2007-06-19 14:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801754, 534601, 8522, '<td valign="top">Good pov, not so good lighting. The ceiling doesn''t help the composition which already feels a little out of balance... there''s too many areas in the frame which don''t do anything especially at the top and left. Great model and expression.</td>', 'Good pov, not so good lighting. The ceiling doesn''t help the composition which already feels a little out of balance... there''s too many areas in the frame which don''t do anything especially at the top and left. Great model and expression.', '2007-06-19 14:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801758, 534476, 8522, '<td valign="top">This shot feels a bit shoehorned into the challenge. Expecially the title. Shame about the cloudy sky which is just pure white in this shot.</td>', 'This shot feels a bit shoehorned into the challenge. Expecially the title. Shame about the cloudy sky which is just pure white in this shot.', '2007-06-19 14:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801765, 533503, 8522, '<td valign="top">Feels accidentally overexposed rather than deliberately high-key. Composition feels off, needs cropping tighter at the top as there''s too much forehead relative to the shot. Also, if you''re going to crop that near the mouth, why leave so much room above the eyes?</td>', 'Feels accidentally overexposed rather than deliberately high-key. Composition feels off, needs cropping tighter at the top as there''s too much forehead relative to the shot. Also, if you''re going to crop that near the mouth, why leave so much room above the eyes?', '2007-06-19 14:16:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801766, 531608, 53243, '<td valign="top">the colors are blown out from post processing, but it''s a nice photo.</td>', 'the colors are blown out from post processing, but it''s a nice photo.', '2007-06-19 14:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801767, 535101, 53243, '<td valign="top">very nice, closeup!</td>', 'very nice, closeup!', '2007-06-19 14:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801771, 533874, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice study in textures and colours. I''d have liked it if you''d given the cow even less space in your composition placing it at the top left of your frame. As a rule, you should aim to have humans and animals facing into negative space.</td>', 'Nice study in textures and colours. I''d have liked it if you''d given the cow even less space in your composition placing it at the top left of your frame. As a rule, you should aim to have humans and animals facing into negative space.', '2007-06-19 14:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801773, 531771, 8522, '<td valign="top">Such a shame it''s flying AWAY! I really don''t like the border, this effect usually strikes me as tacky. Expecially yellow.</td>', 'Such a shame it''s flying AWAY! I really don''t like the border, this effect usually strikes me as tacky. Expecially yellow.', '2007-06-19 14:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801777, 534773, 53243, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the color looks more silver than white.</td>', 'Unfortunately, the color looks more silver than white.', '2007-06-19 14:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801782, 534816, 8522, '<td valign="top">It''s a bottle of water... and a blue background. Although it meets the challenge, I don''t find it interesting in any way. Did you find something interesting about the texture? The shapes in the bottle? Is there a story to it? A strong emotion? To me, it looks like the photographer just saw a bottle of water. The composition doesn''t feel well balanced, and why have the negative space at the top? The wrinkled background doesn''t work for me. The lighting doesn''t hit me with any impact, and the bottle isn''t sharp. Any reason why your point of view is in line with the top of the bottle using a relatively wide-angle focal length?<br/>Hope this helps!</td>', 'It''s a bottle of water... and a blue background. Although it meets the challenge, I don''t find it interesting in any way. Did you find something interesting about the texture? The shapes in the bottle? Is there a story to it? A strong emotion? To me, it looks like the photographer just saw a bottle of water. The composition doesn''t feel well balanced, and why have the negative space at the top? The wrinkled background doesn''t work for me. The lighting doesn''t hit me with any impact, and the bottle isn''t sharp. Any reason why your point of view is in line with the top of the bottle using a relatively wide-angle focal length?Hope this helps!', '2007-06-19 14:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801784, 530613, 8522, '<td valign="top">Looks blurry rather than soft-focus. Soft-focus still needs to communicate that the photographer knows how to focus. Could do with a slightly tighter crop to remove whatever is behind the baby''s head and the other person''s shoulder for more impact. Baby''s face is slightly overexposed. I''d prefer a little more photo above the person''s eyes. Was it deliberate to chop the ear?</td>', 'Looks blurry rather than soft-focus. Soft-focus still needs to communicate that the photographer knows how to focus. Could do with a slightly tighter crop to remove whatever is behind the baby''s head and the other person''s shoulder for more impact. Baby''s face is slightly overexposed. I''d prefer a little more photo above the person''s eyes. Was it deliberate to chop the ear?', '2007-06-19 14:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801786, 534993, 8522, '<td valign="top">Soft-focus gone mad! Nice composition though. Real shame it''s been killed by overusing the blur.</td>', 'Soft-focus gone mad! Nice composition though. Real shame it''s been killed by overusing the blur.', '2007-06-19 14:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801788, 533669, 53243, '<td valign="top">that''s a nice capture</td>', 'that''s a nice capture', '2007-06-19 14:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801795, 533795, 8522, '<td valign="top">This communicates innocence in the way that ANY photo of a baby would communicate it. The composition isn''t great, I''d have been tempted to crop out the forehead, which focuses attention on the eyes, mouth and hand. I would definitely have included a little more of the lower arm. The expression isn''t amazing, especially the mouth. It''s about capturing the special moments, and I don''t believe this is one of them. The foreground element that the baby is lying on doesn''t work for me with the composition.</td>', 'This communicates innocence in the way that ANY photo of a baby would communicate it. The composition isn''t great, I''d have been tempted to crop out the forehead, which focuses attention on the eyes, mouth and hand. I would definitely have included a little more of the lower arm. The expression isn''t amazing, especially the mouth. It''s about capturing the special moments, and I don''t believe this is one of them. The foreground element that the baby is lying on doesn''t work for me with the composition.', '2007-06-19 14:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801800, 532245, 54033, '<td valign="top">I do not know what to say. This is a photo 10</td>', 'I do not know what to say. This is a photo 10', '2007-06-19 14:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801802, 530203, 8522, '<td valign="top">The eyes should ALWAYS be the element of the shot which is in focus, here it''s the hair nearest the camera. As a rule, try to get people looking INTO negative space. Here, everything left of the eyes really serves no purpose in the photo.</td>', 'The eyes should ALWAYS be the element of the shot which is in focus, here it''s the hair nearest the camera. As a rule, try to get people looking INTO negative space. Here, everything left of the eyes really serves no purpose in the photo.', '2007-06-19 14:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3801803, 533925, 8522, '<td valign="top">Snow does give a sense of purity, but I don''t feel it in this photo.</td>', 'Snow does give a sense of purity, but I don''t feel it in this photo.', '2007-06-19 14:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
