(3801816, 534524, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but I feel the effect is overdone on the forehead. I also feel that she is a mutant as I want to see a little of the other eyebrow. The remaining eye has a lot of impact though. Somthing about the pose doesn''t quite work... it feels that she''s struggling to remove a flower which has been stuck up her nose rather than coyly hiding behind it. Perhaps the eye should be a bit nearer the flower?</td>', 'Very nice, but I feel the effect is overdone on the forehead. I also feel that she is a mutant as I want to see a little of the other eyebrow. The remaining eye has a lot of impact though. Somthing about the pose doesn''t quite work... it feels that she''s struggling to remove a flower which has been stuck up her nose rather than coyly hiding behind it. Perhaps the eye should be a bit nearer the flower?', '2007-06-19 14:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
