(3802893, 532163, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot!  I love the angle, the bokeh, the conversion to B&amp;W, but mostly his expression!  Very well done.</td>', 'Wonderful shot!  I love the angle, the bokeh, the conversion to B&W, but mostly his expression!  Very well done.', '2007-06-19 17:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802895, 535314, 30982, '<td valign="top">Aww, man, that face is simply too sweet to resist!  Here''s hoping Velvet found a home though I can''t see how she wouldn''t.  Delightful composition and presentation.  Excellent work.</td>', 'Aww, man, that face is simply too sweet to resist!  Here''s hoping Velvet found a home though I can''t see how she wouldn''t.  Delightful composition and presentation.  Excellent work.', '2007-06-19 17:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802897, 533780, 30982, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness - what a wonderful photograph!  True joy indeed - radiates from this.</td>', 'Oh my goodness - what a wonderful photograph!  True joy indeed - radiates from this.', '2007-06-19 18:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802900, 532429, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  When this came up on the screen it took my breath away.</td>', 'Wonderful.  When this came up on the screen it took my breath away.', '2007-06-19 18:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802904, 533290, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yep, that pretty much sums it up.  Very well done.  There''s a softness and gentleness in both their expressions - light serves this very well and the composition and crop supports the closeness.</td>', 'Yep, that pretty much sums it up.  Very well done.  There''s a softness and gentleness in both their expressions - light serves this very well and the composition and crop supports the closeness.', '2007-06-19 18:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802906, 534846, 30982, '<td valign="top">The sharpness of the mosses contrasted with the smoothness of the falls make this pleasing to me (and I''m not a fan of waterfalls in general).  But what gives it the "quietude" is the branch in the foreground.  Kinda zenlike.</td>', 'The sharpness of the mosses contrasted with the smoothness of the falls make this pleasing to me (and I''m not a fan of waterfalls in general).  But what gives it the "quietude" is the branch in the foreground.  Kinda zenlike.', '2007-06-19 18:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802907, 534768, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is breathtaking.  Everything works - the light (so very soft), those curles, the downturned face, the composition.  Awesome.  Pure, indeed.</td>', 'This is breathtaking.  Everything works - the light (so very soft), those curles, the downturned face, the composition.  Awesome.  Pure, indeed.', '2007-06-19 18:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802908, 534494, 30982, '<td valign="top">The exposure control here is excellent.  A very intriguing and strangely powerful image.</td>', 'The exposure control here is excellent.  A very intriguing and strangely powerful image.', '2007-06-19 18:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802909, 530964, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro - fascinating bug.</td>', 'Excellent macro - fascinating bug.', '2007-06-19 18:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802911, 534692, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent product shot - definitely ad-worthy.</td>', 'Excellent product shot - definitely ad-worthy.', '2007-06-19 18:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802919, 531935, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent angle and DOF - makes for a good "you are there!" shot.</td>', 'Excellent angle and DOF - makes for a good "you are there!" shot.', '2007-06-19 18:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802931, 531583, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very sweet!  And it makes me wonder where mama is and why she''s not yelling at this young man.</td>', 'Very sweet!  And it makes me wonder where mama is and why she''s not yelling at this young man.', '2007-06-19 18:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
