(3802974, 534929, 70661, '<td valign="top">My favorite so far. I love the feel of the photo. With the hat folded up like that I can almost feel the wind blowing. 10</td>', 'My favorite so far. I love the feel of the photo. With the hat folded up like that I can almost feel the wind blowing. 10', '2007-06-19 18:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
