(3803355, 535097, 15407, '<td valign="top">Wow... Two of my favorite subjects! The Isle of Man &amp; John McGuinness setting the first ever 130+ MPH AVERAGE lap speed !!! I''m sure that he was in just the right spot with all of the optimum conditions for you to get this historic picture!  "Luck is when preparation meets opportunity".   You were lucky to get such a historic picture!  No doubt using a fast shutter speed diminished the motion blur.  Minor nitpick ~ Just wondering if you had any filters in your bag of tricks to diminish some of the glare reflecting off of the bodywork?  Great picture... added it to my favorites!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-14 00:34:56.</i></td>', 'Wow... Two of my favorite subjects! The Isle of Man & John McGuinness setting the first ever 130+ MPH AVERAGE lap speed !!! I''m sure that he was in just the right spot with all of the optimum conditions for you to get this historic picture!  "Luck is when preparation meets opportunity".   You were lucky to get such a historic picture!  No doubt using a fast shutter speed diminished the motion blur.  Minor nitpick ~ Just wondering if you had any filters in your bag of tricks to diminish some of the glare reflecting off of the bodywork?  Great picture... added it to my favorites!', '2007-06-19 20:00:44.000000', '2007-08-14 01:34:56.000000', 1),
(3803376, 535485, 76430, '<td valign="top">Not very sharp.  Did you intend the horizon to be tilted?  It doesn''t demonstrate pure relaxation to me.</td>', 'Not very sharp.  Did you intend the horizon to be tilted?  It doesn''t demonstrate pure relaxation to me.', '2007-06-19 20:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803383, 530103, 76430, '<td valign="top">Barely sharp enough to figure out what it is.  You might have to back off a bit and crop the unwanted part out to get a sharper picture.</td>', 'Barely sharp enough to figure out what it is.  You might have to back off a bit and crop the unwanted part out to get a sharper picture.', '2007-06-19 20:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
