(3805947, 534929, 30807, '<td valign="top">Very evocative - I didn''t see where you''re from, but it looks like America, though the hat seems more like an edwardian English hat, so I feel kind of lost geographically. <br/> <br/>I had a flashback to the ''60''s, where a track from Acker Bilk was played, with a pix of his bowler hat put on a hanger of a photo of Ilkley moor, and it just seemed like it somehow.<br/> <br/>So, very evocative to me. I really like the subtle tones in the landscape, and it seems a well deserved Yellow - hope for more later</td>', 'Very evocative - I didn''t see where you''re from, but it looks like America, though the hat seems more like an edwardian English hat, so I feel kind of lost geographically.  I had a flashback to the ''60''s, where a track from Acker Bilk was played, with a pix of his bowler hat put on a hanger of a photo of Ilkley moor, and it just seemed like it somehow. So, very evocative to me. I really like the subtle tones in the landscape, and it seems a well deserved Yellow - hope for more later', '2007-06-20 06:09:59.000000', NULL, 0),
