(3806121, 530996, 902, '<td valign="top">I thought long and hard about the title.  Since he does this for a living and I have several shots with the exact same expression I figured it wasn''t actually terror.  As for distance this was taken about 7ft from the rider.  I actually had the camera between the fence.  Thanks for all the comments.  Also he didn''t actually fall from this one.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-20 06:34:26.</i></td>', 'I thought long and hard about the title.  Since he does this for a living and I have several shots with the exact same expression I figured it wasn''t actually terror.  As for distance this was taken about 7ft from the rider.  I actually had the camera between the fence.  Thanks for all the comments.  Also he didn''t actually fall from this one.', '2007-06-20 07:33:41.000000', '2007-06-20 07:34:26.000000', 0),
