(3808125, 533399, 6349, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the almost-ribbon on your first entry!  I suffered from the same start (although it was 100 years ago when it was a lot easier to do well here).<br/> <br/>edit:  congrats on your RIBBON  :)  You can <i>almost</i> only go down from here but we hope you stick around.<br/> <br/>Welcome to the site.  Look forward to seeing more of your work.  It''s obvious that you have crazy skills to share with us.<br/> <br/>I know it''s already been said but I have to say it again:  Great name!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-21 00:08:29.</i></td>', 'Congrats on the almost-ribbon on your first entry!  I suffered from the same start (although it was 100 years ago when it was a lot easier to do well here). edit:  congrats on your RIBBON  :)  You can almost only go down from here but we hope you stick around. Welcome to the site.  Look forward to seeing more of your work.  It''s obvious that you have crazy skills to share with us. I know it''s already been said but I have to say it again:  Great name!', '2007-06-20 13:25:37.000000', '2007-06-21 01:08:29.000000', 0),
