(3810935, 533503, 66494, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BobsterLobster:</b></div><hr/><i> Feels accidentally overexposed rather than deliberately high-key. Composition feels off, needs cropping tighter at the top as there''s too much forehead relative to the shot. Also, if you''re going to crop that near the mouth, why leave so much room above the eyes? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Absolutely disagree with everything he said. I think this is a GREAT shot, perfect as is. I wish I would have voted this challenge ... you would have been upped in score. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-20 19:35:50.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by BobsterLobster: Feels accidentally overexposed rather than deliberately high-key. Composition feels off, needs cropping tighter at the top as there''s too much forehead relative to the shot. Also, if you''re going to crop that near the mouth, why leave so much room above the eyes?   Absolutely disagree with everything he said. I think this is a GREAT shot, perfect as is. I wish I would have voted this challenge ... you would have been upped in score. ', '2007-06-20 20:35:07.000000', '2007-06-20 20:35:50.000000', 0),
