(3811062, 533282, 44877, '<td valign="top">This got a 5.4? You''ve got to be kidding me. This is so pretty! And should totally appeal to DPC - I don''t get it. The DOF is great, the flower is a little bright - but hey - in the greater scope of things it''s not a big deal. The bee is awesome. Whatever - this is just frustrating. Stupid Voters.</td>', 'This got a 5.4? You''ve got to be kidding me. This is so pretty! And should totally appeal to DPC - I don''t get it. The DOF is great, the flower is a little bright - but hey - in the greater scope of things it''s not a big deal. The bee is awesome. Whatever - this is just frustrating. Stupid Voters.', '2007-06-20 21:07:25.000000', NULL, 0),
