(3811252, 531244, 45475, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Aimee!</td>', 'Congratulations Aimee!', '2007-06-20 21:47:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3811270, 534262, 62787, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Frankie_Lv:</b></div><hr/><i> Hi,<br/>  Don''t know what to think about this. You entered this in a challange but in your comment box you indicate not once, but twice that you did not take this image. How this did not get DQ"ed is what I would like to know ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Oh, the challenge rules are quite specific about this. You photo must be "taken and post-processed by you. Someone else may press the shutter button if you set up the shot and the camera settings. No one else may post-process your entry for you." The camera was on manual settings, which were adjusted by me at the start. Also the zoom, the angle of the shot, etc. were all picked by me, the person pressing the shutter button was quite specifically told to do just that. I can give you examples of ribbon winners doing exactly this, it''s not all that uncommon.</td>', 'Originally posted by Frankie_Lv: Hi,  Don''t know what to think about this. You entered this in a challange but in your comment box you indicate not once, but twice that you did not take this image. How this did not get DQ"ed is what I would like to know ?   Oh, the challenge rules are quite specific about this. You photo must be "taken and post-processed by you. Someone else may press the shutter button if you set up the shot and the camera settings. No one else may post-process your entry for you." The camera was on manual settings, which were adjusted by me at the start. Also the zoom, the angle of the shot, etc. were all picked by me, the person pressing the shutter button was quite specifically told to do just that. I can give you examples of ribbon winners doing exactly this, it''s not all that uncommon.', '2007-06-20 21:50:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3811274, 534208, 67697, '<td valign="top">What a fun pic!  I have to tell you tho, what really caught my eye first were the two people on the right.  The man and woman giving praise just cracks me up.  Great catch!</td>', 'What a fun pic!  I have to tell you tho, what really caught my eye first were the two people on the right.  The man and woman giving praise just cracks me up.  Great catch!', '2007-06-20 21:50:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3811285, 533783, 67697, '<td valign="top">Bet you dragged them all in with your title.  Great closeup!  I would have been about 15 feet away to take the pic - I hate bugs!  Lovely colors as well.</td>', 'Bet you dragged them all in with your title.  Great closeup!  I would have been about 15 feet away to take the pic - I hate bugs!  Lovely colors as well.', '2007-06-20 21:52:22.000000', NULL, 0),
