(3811297, 534226, 67697, '<td valign="top">What a lovely, thought provoking picture.  It is truly a shame that vandals have to use this for an artistic outlet, but again, the imagery is quite striking.  Great clarity and contrast on the photo.  I agree with the person who suggested a little cropping off the top (to help bring more focus towards the main drawing.)  Definitely an underrated photo.  Thanks for sharing!</td>', 'What a lovely, thought provoking picture.  It is truly a shame that vandals have to use this for an artistic outlet, but again, the imagery is quite striking.  Great clarity and contrast on the photo.  I agree with the person who suggested a little cropping off the top (to help bring more focus towards the main drawing.)  Definitely an underrated photo.  Thanks for sharing!', '2007-06-20 21:55:02.000000', NULL, 0),
