(3811357, 534699, 45475, '<td valign="top">The angle and tilt hasn''t helped you here. Probably would have fared better had you taken the shot straight on with either soft backlight or underlight. Diffused light would have prevented those glaring blown highlights. Anyway you look at it though, it''s not a very exciting subject and it feels as though there was no effort or thought on your part. Had I voted in this challenge, honestly, I would have given it a 3 at best.</td>', 'The angle and tilt hasn''t helped you here. Probably would have fared better had you taken the shot straight on with either soft backlight or underlight. Diffused light would have prevented those glaring blown highlights. Anyway you look at it though, it''s not a very exciting subject and it feels as though there was no effort or thought on your part. Had I voted in this challenge, honestly, I would have given it a 3 at best.', '2007-06-20 22:05:30.000000', NULL, 0),
