(3819747, 534445, 28710, '<td valign="top">I think the thickness of the border is appropriate, but I wonder if it might be a bit nicer with a softer color such as one sampled from a bit inwards from one of the edges. personal taste really. Great job as usual :)</td>', 'I think the thickness of the border is appropriate, but I wonder if it might be a bit nicer with a softer color such as one sampled from a bit inwards from one of the edges. personal taste really. Great job as usual :)', '2007-06-22 09:16:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3819753, 534504, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful piece, Sevil!  I have to admit I''ve clicked on it twice since the challenge just to enjoy it for a moment or two, and each time meant to leave a comment but really can''t quite explain why I like it so.  Perhaps it''s just the anonymous stolen moment thing, or the delight of the two feet in motion.  I don''t know.  But I do know that it''s a pleasure to view - repeatedly.</td>', 'This is a wonderful piece, Sevil!  I have to admit I''ve clicked on it twice since the challenge just to enjoy it for a moment or two, and each time meant to leave a comment but really can''t quite explain why I like it so.  Perhaps it''s just the anonymous stolen moment thing, or the delight of the two feet in motion.  I don''t know.  But I do know that it''s a pleasure to view - repeatedly.', '2007-06-22 09:17:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3819760, 532325, 53572, '<td valign="top">too bad about the dq.  honestly, one willy, and it''s not like it''s standing up and saying ''look at me''!  ah well, great shot, well done.</td>', 'too bad about the dq.  honestly, one willy, and it''s not like it''s standing up and saying ''look at me''!  ah well, great shot, well done.', '2007-06-22 09:23:33.000000', NULL, 0),
