(3819831, 530416, 66597, '<td valign="top">Julianne!!!! This is so exciting!!! Mega congrats on your first ribbon, very highly deserved! I actually considered photographing a white peacock for this challenge as well, as I know where a few live and they are regularly in mating plumage right now (feathers out). I love your bg choice. Most wonderful.</td>', 'Julianne!!!! This is so exciting!!! Mega congrats on your first ribbon, very highly deserved! I actually considered photographing a white peacock for this challenge as well, as I know where a few live and they are regularly in mating plumage right now (feathers out). I love your bg choice. Most wonderful.', '2007-06-22 10:07:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(3819836, 531006, 66597, '<td valign="top">This is very, very cool. I am adding to faves.</td>', 'This is very, very cool. I am adding to faves.', '2007-06-22 10:08:42.000000', NULL, 0),
