(3821164, 533365, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Definitely a great way to spend an afternoon!!  All you need is some dip to go with those chips.  And a beer.  :-)</td>', 'Heh!  Definitely a great way to spend an afternoon!!  All you need is some dip to go with those chips.  And a beer.  :-)', '2007-06-22 18:10:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(3821170, 534262, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very wicked way cool.  Or hot if you happend to be Nick.  I love what you do with fire and a camera!  It''s a portal trying to suck him in...</td>', 'Very wicked way cool.  Or hot if you happend to be Nick.  I love what you do with fire and a camera!  It''s a portal trying to suck him in...', '2007-06-22 18:12:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(3821178, 535392, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely a bit on the depressing side.  I get the feeling the subject has just lost a very large chunk of change.  And I like that the subject is the second thing you notice - for some reason it makes this more effective.</td>', 'Definitely a bit on the depressing side.  I get the feeling the subject has just lost a very large chunk of change.  And I like that the subject is the second thing you notice - for some reason it makes this more effective.', '2007-06-22 18:14:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3821180, 532825, 30982, '<td valign="top">Woot!  Congrats on a great score and a new top row shot.  This really intrigued me when voting - you''ve managed to really personify a flower, giving it "ambition" indeed.</td>', 'Woot!  Congrats on a great score and a new top row shot.  This really intrigued me when voting - you''ve managed to really personify a flower, giving it "ambition" indeed.', '2007-06-22 18:15:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(3821183, 533339, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the magenta blooms and you did a very good job not blowing out the color on them (it''s hard to shoot magenta well!)</td>', 'I love the magenta blooms and you did a very good job not blowing out the color on them (it''s hard to shoot magenta well!)', '2007-06-22 18:16:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(3821188, 535353, 30982, '<td valign="top">Way cool - love how you caught the swirlies in the bubble!  Very nicely composed - your background compliments this well.  Congrats on a new top row score, too!</td>', 'Way cool - love how you caught the swirlies in the bubble!  Very nicely composed - your background compliments this well.  Congrats on a new top row score, too!', '2007-06-22 18:17:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3821192, 535228, 30982, '<td valign="top">This comes across to me as slightly bittersweet.  The pure innocence of the sleeping child with a slight bit of anxiety from the mother, wondering if she''ll be able to handle all that is yet to come.  Very well done.</td>', 'This comes across to me as slightly bittersweet.  The pure innocence of the sleeping child with a slight bit of anxiety from the mother, wondering if she''ll be able to handle all that is yet to come.  Very well done.', '2007-06-22 18:20:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3821199, 533503, 30982, '<td valign="top">Score be damned, Darren, this is an exceptional high key portrait that speaks to me of the brilliance and wonder of childhood.</td>', 'Score be damned, Darren, this is an exceptional high key portrait that speaks to me of the brilliance and wonder of childhood.', '2007-06-22 18:21:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3821205, 533842, 30982, '<td valign="top">Well I like it.  :-)</td>', 'Well I like it.  :-)', '2007-06-22 18:23:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3821213, 533783, 30982, '<td valign="top">The title rocks, but beyond that you used a lovely DOF here to create a truly intimate photograph.  This is really quite gorgeous!</td>', 'The title rocks, but beyond that you used a lovely DOF here to create a truly intimate photograph.  This is really quite gorgeous!', '2007-06-22 18:25:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(3821225, 534953, 30982, '<td valign="top">Everybody''s gotta have their water drop on roses shot.  :-)  I don''t say that in a derogatory way, just that it does seem this is a shot everyone tries at least once (and I''ve tried it, too).  On my monitor, which is kinda strong on reds, it''s definitely bold and vibrant, perhaps a bit too much so.  To really make shots like this succeed, I think you need to have some depth to the shot - shoot across the petal more than just straight on.</td>', 'Everybody''s gotta have their water drop on roses shot.  :-)  I don''t say that in a derogatory way, just that it does seem this is a shot everyone tries at least once (and I''ve tried it, too).  On my monitor, which is kinda strong on reds, it''s definitely bold and vibrant, perhaps a bit too much so.  To really make shots like this succeed, I think you need to have some depth to the shot - shoot across the petal more than just straight on.', '2007-06-22 18:29:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3821231, 534486, 30982, '<td valign="top">Quite like it and appreciate the unique approach to the challenge.  And the background isn''t ugly, it just is!</td>', 'Quite like it and appreciate the unique approach to the challenge.  And the background isn''t ugly, it just is!', '2007-06-22 18:30:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3821240, 533494, 30982, '<td valign="top">GREAT shoes and I really love the color!  Maybe just a tad awkward compositionally - kinda feels a bit off balance to me, but I''m an anal retentive engineer.  :-)  Either straight, or a stronger angle, perhaps?  Or maybe just a bit more breathing room at the top.  And I want a pair...</td>', 'GREAT shoes and I really love the color!  Maybe just a tad awkward compositionally - kinda feels a bit off balance to me, but I''m an anal retentive engineer.  :-)  Either straight, or a stronger angle, perhaps?  Or maybe just a bit more breathing room at the top.  And I want a pair...', '2007-06-22 18:33:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(3821406, 534103, 41047, '<td valign="top">this is priceless, i love the way the little guy on the top looks :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-22 18:26:22.</i></td>', 'this is priceless, i love the way the little guy on the top looks :)', '2007-06-22 19:25:55.000000', '2007-06-22 19:26:22.000000', 0),
