(3846162, 535097, 15407, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on this excellent picture. I know that you had a fine set of tools to use on your trip and little or no time to familiarize yourself with them before landing in the ''Heaven on Earth'' of motorcycle racing... I couldn''t make the trip ~ as much as I wanted to!  I''m glad you got to go and capture great photos, which will no doubt be a everlasting legacy of the trip. I suspect that nothing will compare with actually ''being there'' for the Centenary Celebration of the Isle of Man TT Races. I''ll be watching for other photo''s of the trip entered into the Free Study 2007 - 06 and/or the Best Of 2007! <br/> <br/>How fast do you estimate John was traveling when you coatured this shot? (Yes VERY is the right answer! ~ wondering about Kph/Mph ?) <br/></td>', 'Congratulations on this excellent picture. I know that you had a fine set of tools to use on your trip and little or no time to familiarize yourself with them before landing in the ''Heaven on Earth'' of motorcycle racing... I couldn''t make the trip ~ as much as I wanted to!  I''m glad you got to go and capture great photos, which will no doubt be a everlasting legacy of the trip. I suspect that nothing will compare with actually ''being there'' for the Centenary Celebration of the Isle of Man TT Races. I''ll be watching for other photo''s of the trip entered into the Free Study 2007 - 06 and/or the Best Of 2007!  How fast do you estimate John was traveling when you coatured this shot? (Yes VERY is the right answer! ~ wondering about Kph/Mph ?) ', '2007-06-28 19:51:01.000000', NULL, 0),
