(4432928, 535647, 72268, '<td valign="top">I love the innocence portrayed in this photo. Brings me a sense of hope and puts me in good spirits. I believe however, that you should adjust the saturation, levels, as the colors are a little flat. But then again, I like it just the way it is. Also it is a little centered and the focus is not on her eyes as I would like.</td>', 'I love the innocence portrayed in this photo. Brings me a sense of hope and puts me in good spirits. I believe however, that you should adjust the saturation, levels, as the colors are a little flat. But then again, I like it just the way it is. Also it is a little centered and the focus is not on her eyes as I would like.', '2008-01-28 13:06:04.000000', NULL, 0),
