(4825017, 535097, 33672, '<td valign="top">Super sharp! What a  pleasure it must''ve been to be able to shoot this event that is more traditional than the races at Laconia. Great capture. How wide/narrow was the focal length? The clarity of the back ground makes me believe that it was wide open. Do you think a 2.8 lens would''ve gotten this sharper? I''ve seen guys use the 18-200 at the speedbowl where I shoot sometimes,but they always use a flash.</td>', 'Super sharp! What a  pleasure it must''ve been to be able to shoot this event that is more traditional than the races at Laconia. Great capture. How wide/narrow was the focal length? The clarity of the back ground makes me believe that it was wide open. Do you think a 2.8 lens would''ve gotten this sharper? I''ve seen guys use the 18-200 at the speedbowl where I shoot sometimes,but they always use a flash.', '2008-07-14 20:15:42.000000', NULL, 0),
