(4937674, 534935, 69008, '<td valign="top">The negative treatment does a nice job of bringing out the open mouth and eyes. It also makes the fur look different which is good too.  I like the punny title too.  It just isn''t what''s in vogue at DPC at the moment, by the comments and votes. That''s ok. I still like it.<br/>I think that it may be because it reminds me of many hours at the enlarger looking at negative images on the easel and thinking about what to dodge and what to burn. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-09-06 02:55:32.</i></td>', 'The negative treatment does a nice job of bringing out the open mouth and eyes. It also makes the fur look different which is good too.  I like the punny title too.  It just isn''t what''s in vogue at DPC at the moment, by the comments and votes. That''s ok. I still like it.I think that it may be because it reminds me of many hours at the enlarger looking at negative images on the easel and thinking about what to dodge and what to burn. ', '2008-09-06 03:53:43.000000', '2008-09-06 03:55:32.000000', 0),
(4955485, 534440, 48228, '<td valign="top">Nice to see something quite different in your portfolio, as this is a pleasing composition, with a soft touch.....</td>', 'Nice to see something quite different in your portfolio, as this is a pleasing composition, with a soft touch.....', '2008-09-15 01:18:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5058163, 530416, 32872, '<td valign="top">Hi Julie!!!  I''m slow, but I just realized we both won ribbons for a white peacock image!!!! Awesome don''t you think?  I love your image, btw.</td>', 'Hi Julie!!!  I''m slow, but I just realized we both won ribbons for a white peacock image!!!! Awesome don''t you think?  I love your image, btw.', '2008-11-11 22:55:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5107397, 533399, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am so sorry this was DQ''d. It is an exceptional photo. Such great texture. Such great leading lines. I would love to see more work like this from you. It shows you have a real talent. I gave it a 10 in the voting FWIW.</td>', 'I am so sorry this was DQ''d. It is an exceptional photo. Such great texture. Such great leading lines. I would love to see more work like this from you. It shows you have a real talent. I gave it a 10 in the voting FWIW.', '2008-12-04 23:27:18.000000', NULL, 0),
